    "title": "EY01 Flowers Watch Face",
    "description": "This is a beautiful high quality digital \"EY01 Flowers Digital Watch Face 12h/24h\" watchface.\r\nThis watchface supports Wear OS 3 and copmatible with devices: Samsung Galaxy Watch 4, 5, 6 series and other devices.\r\n\r\n* NOT for Samsung Gear S3, Sport and Galaxy Watch series (running Tizen OS) !!! * \r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Digital time 12h/24h (based on your phone settings)\r\n- Date, day of week\r\n- Battery indicator\r\n- Step counts\r\n- Heart rate\r\n- Always on display (AOD) supported\r\n- 4 App shortcuts: Phone, Settings, Battery status, Heart rate (single tap to open shortcuts)\r\n\r\n\r\nInstagram\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/erlyenwatch/\r\n\r\nFor support you can email me to\r\nerlyenwatch@gmail.com",
